*.iopin DVSS
*.opin q
*.opin qn
x1 d e DVDD net2 DVSS NAND
x2 e net1 DVDD net3 DVSS NAND
x3 net2 qn DVDD q DVSS NAND
x4 q net3 DVDD qn DVSS NAND
x5 DVDD d net1 DVSS Inv1
.ends


